<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>房地产行业研究报告</title><link>https://research.ke.com/ResearchResults</link><atom:link href="http://rss.wudifeixue.com/ke/researchResults" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>研究成果 - Made with love by RSSHub(https://github.com/DIYgod/RSSHub)</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>i@diygod.me (DIYgod)</webMaster><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 01 Dec 2025 00:28:14 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>2023年三季度中国住房租赁市场发展报告出炉</title><description>市场活跃度上升，三季度租金同比下跌，环比先涨后跌</description><link>https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=552</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=552</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Oct 2023 07:05:56 GMT</pubDate><author>贝壳研究院</author></item><item><title>2023郑州住房租赁市场洞察</title><description>2023年，清华大学建筑学院住宅与社区研究所与贝壳研究院联合发起了一项住房消费需求调研。</description><link>https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=550</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=550</guid><pubDate>Wed, 28 Jun 2023 06:17:47 GMT</pubDate><author>贝壳研究院</author></item><item><title>2023家装消费品质报告</title><description></description><link>https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=549</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=549</guid><pubDate>Fri, 19 May 2023 10:14:19 GMT</pubDate><author>贝壳研究院</author></item><item><title>居住改善的新趋势</title><description>近年来，为了提升居住品质和获得更好的城市公共资源，越来越多的家庭通过卖一买一、卖旧买新的方式实现以房换房。</description><link>https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=548</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=548</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 May 2023 07:42:38 GMT</pubDate><author>贝壳研究院</author></item><item><title>北京整装市场白皮书发布：超65%的家装消费者选择整装</title><description></description><link>https://research.ke.com/122/ArticleDetail?id=547</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://research.ke.com/122/ArticleDetail?id=547</guid><pubDate>Fri, 28 Apr 2023 02:53:09 GMT</pubDate><author>贝壳研究院</author></item><item><title>中国住房租赁市场发展报告</title><description>2023年4月14日，由纬房研究院、贝壳研究院、新华网产业经济研究院、中国城市经济学会房地产专业委员会联合课题组完成的《中国住房租赁市场发展报告（2023年一季度）》正式发布。</description><link>https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=546</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=546</guid><pubDate>Fri, 14 Apr 2023 09:38:03 GMT</pubDate><author>贝壳研究院</author></item><item><title>家庭小型化趋势下首套住房需求测算</title><description>我国家庭规模经历快速收缩后已跌破3人，2020年为2.62人。独居趋势明显，每4个家庭就有一个独居户。</description><link>https://research.ke.com/122/ArticleDetail?id=545</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://research.ke.com/122/ArticleDetail?id=545</guid><pubDate>Thu, 06 Apr 2023 08:15:36 GMT</pubDate><author>贝壳研究院</author></item><item><title>从80平到110平！换房时代之青岛样本</title><description>本期市场分析贝壳研究院聚焦青岛，研究这座沿海宜居城市的居住特征及趋势。</description><link>https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=544</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=544</guid><pubDate>Fri, 31 Mar 2023 03:15:42 GMT</pubDate><author>贝壳研究院</author></item><item><title>如何看待1月信贷开门红？</title><description>1 月信贷“企业强、居民弱”的信贷结构只是表象，一季度居民信贷有望迎来明显拐点。</description><link>https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=542</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://research.ke.com/130/ArticleDetail?id=542</guid><pubDate>Thu, 16 Feb 2023 07:27:03 GMT</pubDate><author>贝壳研究院</author></item></channel></rss>